==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 6.67~16.67 seconds<sup>200f~500f</sup>.
*8 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07~3.33 seconds<sup>2f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*3 [[Shy Boy]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Teacher A]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
**10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**3 [[St. Pigge the 2nd]]s spawn, delay 1.33~3.33 seconds<sup>40f~100f</sup>.

==Strategy==
The major threat of the level is the Shy Boy rush at the start. Once you survive that, the rest comes down to killing Teacher A. Use [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|Anti-Red Cats]] and [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|Anti-Floating Cats]] to deal with the Shy Boys, while using bulkier cats to deal with Teacher A. and the three St. Pigge the 2nds.

